unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place kb: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input amt: money PLN
input w: date
input lim: money PLN
input lim2: money PLN
input sp: month

move dt: transfers
  on w
  reads konto
  when bal(konto) > lim
  leg cash from world to konto amount amt
move df: transfers
  on w
  reads konto
  when bal(konto) > lim2
  leg cash from world to kb amount amt

def cn: int = count(m in transfers over sp .. sp)
def ff: money PLN = flows(df, sp .. sp)

ask e_cn: explain cn
ask i_cn: inputs-of cn
ask e_ff: explain ff
ask i_ff: inputs-of ff

